ub.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118045","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118045.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118045.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-10T18:16:36Z"},"body":"Heavily based on bend studios [approach](https://www.bendstudio.com/blog/inside-bend-screen-space-shadows/)\r\n\r\nAdds a new option the environment resource and directional light node to enable screen space contact shadows (SSCS). It creates an R8 shadow texture for each directional light in the scene and blends them with existing shadow maps.\r\n\r\nTodos:\r\n- [x] Simplify/Remove some settings\r\n- [x] Early out settings based on depth and normals\r\n- [x] Documentation\r\n- [x] Remove debug code\r\n- [x] Added orthogonal camera support\r\n- [x] Opacity(?)\r\n- [x] ~Dithering/Soft-shadows~ Blur\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\n- *Bugsquad edit: This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14141.*\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin